&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#00ff00;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; HABERLEŞME PROTOKOLÜ:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt;ROS 2 Humble&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; (DDS Middleware, Pub/Sub Mimarisi) &amp;amp; Kriptolu 2.4 GHz Telemetri &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#00ff00;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; GCS ALTYAPISI:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; Python 3.12 | PyQt5 | Asenkron QThread Motoru &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#00ffff;&quot;&gt;[ SENSÖR FÜZYONU VE DURUM YÖNETİMİ ]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;square&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; color:#00ff00;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt;LİDAR ALTYAPISI:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt; 360 Derece Çevresel Tarama, Haritalama (SLAM) ve Engel Algılama&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; color:#00ff00;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt;GÖRÜNTÜ İŞLEME:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt; Düşük Gecikmeli (Low-Latency) Kamera Akışı ve Nesne Tespiti&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; color:#00ff00;&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt;TELEMETRİ:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt; 50ms Gecikme ile Canlı Durum Taraması ve Güvenlik Döngüsü (Fail-Safe)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:16px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot; margin-top:14px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#00ffff;&quot;&gt;[ TAKIM BİLGİSİ VE VİZYON ]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:large; font-weight:600; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#00ff00;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; GÖREV GÜCÜ:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; [Takım Adını Buraya Yazın] &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; line-height:160%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt;Teknofest 2026 İnsansız Kara Araçları (İKA) kategorisi için bir araya gelen ekibimiz; yazılım, elektronik ve mekanik disiplinlerini kusursuz bir uyumla birleştirmektedir. Amacımız, sadece yarışma parkurunu tamamlamak değil; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Milli Teknoloji Hamlesi&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#e0e0e0;&quot;&gt; vizyonu doğrultusunda, asimetrik harp koşullarında ve zorlu arazi şartlarında görev yapabilecek, yerli ve milli otonom sistemler için ölçeklenebilir bir Ar-Ge altyapısı sunmaktır. TUFAN, bu vizyonun sahadaki çelik yansımasıdır ve ROS 2 mimarisi ile gelecekteki sürü (swarm) operasyonlarına dahi bugünden hazırdır.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:16px; color:#a0c0d0;&quot;&gt; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'Courier New','monospace'; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; font-style:italic; color:#ff3333;&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;Geleceğin harekat sahasında, kontrol daima güvendedir.&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
